(ii) one or more lenders determine a need for extension of the original / extended Date of Commencement of Commercial Operations (DCCO), as the case may be, of a project;
(iii) expiry of original / extended DCCO, as the case may be;
(iv) one or more lenders determine a need for infusion of additional debt;
